{"4500000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Spell Code SlingerZ","steam_appid":4500000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/5aa9ac92fee88dec020693fbaccc0233.poster.avif?t=1793718517\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/5aa9ac92fee88dec020693fbaccc0233.webm?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/5aa9ac92fee88dec020693fbaccc0233.mp4?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spell Code SlingerZ is a 2-4 player party brawler playable both online and locally! Load in, beat down the opposition, acquire new Spellcodes to create your own personalized build, and beat them down again in a first-to-3-wins style tournament!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/29d213e0b1cca29bb2f8128cc4ee3746.avif?t=1793718517\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras_big\/29d213e0b1cca29bb2f8128cc4ee3746.webp?t=1793718517 width=1560 height=323 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/41a99c51255009fd4a1a3b1513f9f04b.poster.avif?t=1793718517\" aria-label=\"Gif of storing a Spellcode\" width=376 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/41a99c51255009fd4a1a3b1513f9f04b.webm?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/41a99c51255009fd4a1a3b1513f9f04b.mp4?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience our unique twist on the genre! Instead of complicated input sequences for special moves unique to each character, enter the Code Weave state and take as much time as necessary to prime and store your Spellcode before unleashing it upon foes!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/c3b15b9cce3d779d9c59ea9fac615615.avif?t=1793718517\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras_big\/c3b15b9cce3d779d9c59ea9fac615615.webp?t=1793718517 width=1560 height=323 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/88b649244a5d51e382a0872f0d1921ce.poster.avif?t=1793718517\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/88b649244a5d51e382a0872f0d1921ce.webm?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/88b649244a5d51e382a0872f0d1921ce.mp4?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose 1 of up to 9 Spellcodes to add to your arsenal between each battle phase! With a plethora of Spellcodes to choose from and the ability to obtain multiple copies of any given one, the build possibilities are endless!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/94b606828a8f9a4a7e18f1226084eb71.avif?t=1793718517\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras_big\/94b606828a8f9a4a7e18f1226084eb71.webp?t=1793718517 width=1560 height=323 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/cd703a9ff8def44984b7371fbf09fff8.poster.avif?t=1793718517\" width=1014 height=702 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/cd703a9ff8def44984b7371fbf09fff8.webm?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/cd703a9ff8def44984b7371fbf09fff8.mp4?t=1793718517\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each Developer Collective (color) has a unique resource pool &amp; gameplay fantasy that it's geared towards, with a plethora of Spellcodes to support them. Discover which one is best for you, or mix and match them to create something entirely new!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/9c5d58f7ba3ce4b8dee27dc8605efe61.avif?t=1793718517\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras_big\/9c5d58f7ba3ce4b8dee27dc8605efe61.webp?t=1793718517 width=1560 height=323 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy aesthetics signature of the early 2000s with bright colors, neon signs, and a custom score consisting of early 2000s R&amp;B, EDM, and House tracks!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/6b2982b29ea7932332489835d15ca835.avif?t=1793718517\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras_big\/6b2982b29ea7932332489835d15ca835.webp?t=1793718517 width=1560 height=323 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/58ca66e8d200c4b3b379fcb75656dcc8.avif?t=1793718517\" width=517 height=652 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/75b24b67804b869fa25c9b19011fd201.avif?t=1793718517\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras_big\/75b24b67804b869fa25c9b19011fd201.webp?t=1793718517 width=1560 height=323 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4500000\/extras\/884a32345ce5a631f9e9db1df11b8555.avif?t=1793718517\" width=517 height=652 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.c